# OnePlus Pad 2 Pro pogo keyboard (oneplus-pogo-keyboard driver; its keymap is
# indexed by HID keyboard usage). The keyboard firmware sends keyboard usages
# for two top-row keys that ColorOS maps itself: the microphone key sends F13
# (0x68), which desktops treat as the Tools key, and the lock key sends F24
# (0x73), which nothing handles. (The driver's Fn layer would report F3/F6
# for them, but with the magnifier key held these two keys send nothing.)
evdev:name:OnePlus Pad 2 Pro Keyboard:*
 KEYBOARD_KEY_68=micmute
 KEYBOARD_KEY_73=screenlock
